\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. AUTHOR of life divine,
\par Who hast a table spread,
\par Furnished with mystic wine
\par And everlasting bread,
\par Preserve the life Thyself hast given,
\par And feed and train us up for heaven.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Our needy souls sustain
\par With fresh supplies of love,
\par Till all Thy life we gain,
\par And all Thy fullness prove,
\par And, strengthened by Thy perfect grace,
\par Behold without a veil Thy face.
\par                            Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

